<dc:title>&#x0A;           &#x20;<rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">C. Kelliher - Quantitative Finance With Python. A Practical Guide to Investment Management, Trading, and Financial Engineering (2022)[EN]</rdf:li>
